prism 0.1.0: P0–P4 experiments; see prism reproduce --list
usage: prism [-h] [--version] {env,sut,record,verify,reproduce} ...

Prism command-line entry point. Repository experiments, provenance
verification and isolated reproduction.

positional arguments:
  {env,sut,record,verify,reproduce}
    env                 Describe the experiment environment
    sut                 Check the reference model
    record              Save and summarize experiment records
    verify              Verify committed artifact SHA-256 inventory
    reproduce           Reproduce recipes in a repository clone

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             show program's version number and exit
